---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Services" description="Hosting and related services associated with Vinko">
  <article class="page-shell page-shell--narrow">
    <header class="page-header">
      <h1>Services</h1>
      <p class="lead">Quality hosting and related services under the Vinko Treasures brand (hosting.vinko.com).</p>
    </header>
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Shared Web Hosting</h2>
      <p>
        Shared web hosting plans designed for small personal to medium business websites, offering performance and stability at a reasonable price. Features include an advanced control panel, free Let’s Encrypt SSL certificates, managed email with spam protection, free daily backups, and SSH access.
      </p>
      <h2>Node.js / WebApps Hosting</h2>
      <p>
        Deploy and run Node.js projects in a fully managed runtime environment. Upload your project and start it through the graphical interface or CLI. Other runtimes such as Python/Django, Go, and Ruby can also be installed.
      </p>
      <h2>Single-site and Managed VPS</h2>
      <p>
        VPS plans for corporate and high-load websites with guaranteed CPU and RAM allocation, free dedicated IP addresses, RAID6 enterprise SSD storage, and (on managed plans) unlimited websites and mailboxes.
      </p>
      <h2>Platform highlights</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Top-tier internet data centers with fast connectivity</li>
        <li>MySQL and multiple PHP versions, SSH/SFTP, Git, DNS, free SSL</li>
        <li>Managed WordPress tooling (installer, staging, backups, WP-CLI)</li>
        <li>Professional email with spam protection and webmail</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Source: summarized from the public hosting.vinko.com about and home pages in the Version 1 WordPress archive. For current plans and ordering, see the live hosting site when available.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
